        "text": "On the first call, the allocation phase introduces a fresh node t0 whose data and next fields are initially indeterminate. The data phase assigns the first insertion value to t0, and the link phase points t0's next field at the existing head i0. The function then returns t0, and the caller head becomes t0, so the list now begins with the newly inserted node followed by i0.",
